function confirmDefinition(){if(!S.definitionDraft||!Number.isInteger(S.category))return;const def={...S.definitionDraft,category:D.module_categories[S.category]};if(!def.id||!def.version||S.project.definitions.some(x=>x.id===def.id&&x.version===def.version)){notice('定义ID/版本缺项或冲突，原库保持');return;}recordEdit();S.project.definitions.push(def);if(S.category===1){const d=copy(seed().devices[0]);d.id='CUSTOM-'+(S.project.devices.length+1);d.name=def.id;d.definitionId=def.id;d.version=def.version;d.x=3;d.y=3;S.project.instanceState[d.id]={config:copy(seed().device),media:copy(seed().media)};S.project.devices.push(d);S.selected=d.id;S.revision++;S.form=null;view.setProject(S.project);}else S.revision++;$('dialog').close();if(S.category===1)go('VP03',true);else{render();notice('定义草稿已保存到原型九类库，不生成库存或运行能力');}}

